    <grid>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "name": "1 column layout",
  "sections": [
    {
      "grid": "12",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "309e2d4b-2d7d-4f87-ba89-b73f65ff57bf",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<p>In 2019 Roadlab assisted HHO Consulting Engineers to improve the container stacking efficiency of Transnet’s Cape Town Port Terminal, part of a multi-million rand upgrade to critical infrastructure in the Western Cape.</p>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 1690,
                    "udi": "umb://media/73bf5796526c4675856bf2ca98ba6565",
                    "image": "/media/sbll421m/vlcsnap-2020-02-13-16h44m17s392.png"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p> </p>\n<p>Roadlab conducted Falling Weight Deflectometer (FWD) testing, concrete coring and sampling for the project between 2019 and 2020.</p>\n<p>Data received would enable benchmarking of the various layers to include in a pavement loading analysis and derive pavement-strengthening options for improved container stacking efficiency.</p>\n<p>Our testing and quality assurance work within the port terminals formed part of a multi-phase, multi-billion rand upgrade to a facility that is pivotal to the regional economy.</p>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
